t\t\t\t\t<p>ntopng analyzes packets from mirror ports and TAPs, flows exported by routers and switches (NetFlow, sFlow, IPFIX via nProbe), SNMP devices and firewall logs. Read the guide on <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/network-traffic-analysis-software\/\">network traffic analysis software<\/a> or explore the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/solutions\/\">solutions by use case and industry<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6d6147 e-con-boxed e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b6d6147\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8481c74 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8481c74\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Which traffic analysis product do I need?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-32bbba6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"32bbba6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>ntopng is the core of the ntop stack: real-time and historical visibility of hosts, flows and applications, with a free open source Community edition. nAnalyst adds an on-prem AI analyst on top of ntopng data. nEdge and nEdge Lite add Layer-7 policy enforcement for gateways. Most teams start with ntopng and add the others as needed.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57da4d0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"57da4d0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8018c69 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8018c69\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ac5709 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5ac5709\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f0efc4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0f0efc4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Get started<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-256eecf elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"256eecf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Not sure which one to choose?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-51fa23d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"51fa23d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Download the free Community edition, compare editions and buy in the shop, or talk to the ntop team about your requirements.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a0163b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1a0163b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17780e7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-lte-button\" data-id=\"17780e7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"lte-button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"lte-btn-wrap\">\r\n\t<a href=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/support\/documentation\/software-installation\/\"  class=\"lte-btn color-hover-default lte-icon-style-default\"><span class=\"lte-btn-inner\"